/-! # `Run` (amd64): `B3` to `P1` — `Uint64` and `BitLen` of the three length headers (case `TTF`: header i empty = T)

GENERATED by scripts/gen-run-la64.py (agent top); edit the generator, not this file. `BitLen`: smear, `BSR` (the smeared
top limb is non-zero, so `BSR` is defined: `63 - clz`), `(n - 1) << 6 + BSR + 1`. -/

open Janus Janus.Amd64 Janus.Amd64.GoABI Janus.Amd64.Tactic Janus.Spec Janus.Contracts

